  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-tab-alert",
      "text": "> DSH Web tab alert: when an agent turn finishes while the browser tab is in the background, the tab title flashes \"New Message!\"; returning to the tab stops it instantly.\n>\n> [中文](README.zh.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Behavior",
      "text": "- Turn **running**: nothing happens.\n- Turn **finished** while the tab is **hidden**: the title alternates between `New Message!` and the original title every second.\n- User returns to the tab (visibilitychange): blinking stops immediately, the title is restored.\n- Turn finishes while the tab is visible: no blinking (the user already saw it)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Detection",
      "text": "Primary path uses the host client services (same contract as the official `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation`):\n\n```text\nctx.sessions.list.getSnapshot().byId[mainViewSessionId].running\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Detection",
      "text": "`mainViewSessionId` resolves the main-view session via `retainedBy.mainView > 0`; `sessions.list` changes trigger an immediate callback plus a 2s polling fallback. If the service is unavailable or the record lacks the `running` field, it falls back to the DOM check `[data-chat-flow-kind=\"turn-process\"]` (the dsh-auto-collapse contract)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin add dsh-tab-alert        # from npm"
    },
    {
      "section": "or from GitHub:",
      "text": "dsh plugin add github:vemoos-b/dsh-tab-alert\n```\n\nEnable dsh-tab-alert in Settings → Plugins and reload the web UI."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 (web client). MIT license."
    }
  ],
